@product @regression\nFeature: Product Management\n\n  @view-products\n  Scenario: View all products\n    Given the user is logged in\n    When the user views the products\n    Then the product list should be displayed\n\n  @add-to-cart\n  Scenario: Add product to cart\n    Given the user is logged in\n    When the user adds a product to cart\n    Then the cart count should be updated\n\n  @sort-products\n  Scenario Outline: Sort products\n    Given the user is logged in\n    When the user sorts by \"<option>\"\n    Then products are sorted by \"<criteria>\"\n\n    Examples:\n      | option | criteria |\n      | Name A-Z | name-asc |\n      | Price Low-High | price-asc |\n"